{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an impenetrable defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling medieval battles across a variety of locations! Build towers, upgrade them, and repel enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/07649cf8c5d49d999d85148fe85ef48b.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1560 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/19f11ec3e930d354b38f4a967ff90666.poster.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/19f11ec3e930d354b38f4a967ff90666.webm?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/19f11ec3e930d354b38f4a967ff90666.mp4?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your defenses in strategic positions, find the best ways to strike the enemy, and hold the line under any conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/25d339eefd307cb87a0aa19ce6dd93be.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1560 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/f6e9cc64cb565be176a5fdf67285a558.poster.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/f6e9cc64cb565be176a5fdf67285a558.webm?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/f6e9cc64cb565be176a5fdf67285a558.mp4?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each new wave, you encounter increasingly resilient and prepared opponents. Where once a single shot was enough, a full salvo will now be required. Your defense must be ready for anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/8e29d4d67eb17e079c5ef05d14b0b337.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1560 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/092d010a1a955fa243c53fa7e38e2fda.poster.avif?t=1772660223\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/092d010a1a955fa243c53fa7e38e2fda.webm?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4071770/extras/092d010a1a955fa243c53fa7e38e2fda.mp4?t=1772660223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest the gold earned in battle to strengthen your towers. More damage, higher speed\u2014turn each of your structures into an insurmountable obstacle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your defenses, strengthen your towers, and find the right tactics for each battle. One false step and your defense will fall. Will you be able to endure to the end?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4071770?t=1772660223","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4071770?t=1772660223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c